@char Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Nervous_Closed,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
